<style>
        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        
        table{
            width:100%;
        }
        
        table,th, td {
            border: 1px solid black;
            padding:5px;
        }
        
        th,td{
            text-align: left;
        } 
    </style>
    <p>The MaritzCX platform failed to register the MaritzCX for Salesforce package upgrade. Please follow these instructions to complete the upgrade process:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>Log into your Admin account at MaritzCX.</li>
        <li>Go to <b>ADMIN | Company Setup | Salesforce Integration</b>.</li>
        <li>Under <b>Salesforce Settings</b>, click on the <b>Refresh Package Version</b> button.</li>
    </ol> 
    <p>The new features will now be available.</p>   
    
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th colspan="2">Additional Details</th>
            </tr>
